 ],
 "layoutComment": "An FX surface beside the Inpulse, as beats.bitwrap.io maps the APC (lib/backend/apc-mini-mk2.js): the grid is the macro catalog in beats' rows (bottom: mutes; FX; FX; pan; pitch + tempo; feel; —; hits + shape), lit in beats' group colours, bright while a macro runs; the red track buttons mute the aimed deck's parts; the green scene buttons are play, regenerate, auto-next, aim at A, aim at B (SHIFT + either: aim at the loops, L), FX reset (feel-reset), next track, panic; the faders are FX amounts (phaser wet, distortion, the deck's reverb wet and size, LP, HP, master pitch, crush) and master volume. Everything with deck \\\"*\\\" acts on the aimed deck (DJEngine.focus: the scene buttons, or whichever deck a controller touched last). SHIFT + pad: the loop page (loops 1-64). beats' delay and pan macros are not in dj."
}
